00:24:56.640 --> 00:24:58.502
Thank God.

00:24:58.537 --> 00:25:00.579
Where is he?

00:25:00.614 --> 00:25:02.622
He uh...

00:25:02.956 --> 00:25:06.178
I cuffed him to my car.

00:25:27.846 --> 00:25:29.602
Sam?

00:25:30.230 --> 00:25:31.569
Are you hurt?

00:25:31.604 --> 00:25:33.325
No.

00:25:33.534 --> 00:25:36.044
Damn, it's good to see you.

00:25:36.797 --> 00:25:39.893
How did you get out of the cuffs?

00:25:39.928 --> 00:25:42.778
I know a trick or two.

00:25:43.782 --> 00:25:45.749
All right.

00:25:46.000 --> 00:25:47.464
Oh.

00:25:47.757 --> 00:25:50.105
These locks they're gonna be a bitch.

00:25:50.141 --> 00:25:53.362
Well, there's some kind of
automatic control. Right there.

00:25:53.598 --> 00:25:55.444
Have you seen them?

00:25:55.479 --> 00:25:56.748
Yeah.

00:25:56.783 --> 00:25:59.000
Dude, they're just people.

00:25:59.035 --> 00:26:01.098
And they jumped you?

00:26:01.134 --> 00:26:04.647
Must be getting a little
rusty there, kiddo.

00:26:04.682 --> 00:26:05.672
What do they want?

00:26:05.707 --> 00:26:06.438
I don't know.

00:26:06.439 --> 00:26:08.303
They let Jenkins go, but...

00:26:08.338 --> 00:26:10.134
That was some sort of trap.

00:26:10.169 --> 00:26:12.252
It doesn't make any sense to me.

00:26:12.287 --> 00:26:13.646
Oh, well that's the point.

00:26:13.681 --> 00:26:14.860
You know with...

00:26:14.896 --> 00:26:18.911
Our usual play mates there's rules,
here's patterns. But with people...

00:26:18.946 --> 00:26:20.759
They're just crazy.

00:26:20.794 --> 00:26:23.345
You see anything else out there?

00:26:24.139 --> 00:26:26.712
He has about a dozen junk cars
out back. Plates from all over.

00:26:26.747 --> 00:26:29.284
So, I'm thinking when they take
someone they take their car too.

00:26:29.319 --> 00:26:33.426
Did you see a black mustang?
Out there about ten years old?

00:26:33.461 --> 00:26:36.982
Yeah, actually I did.

00:26:38.663 --> 00:26:41.674
Your brothers?

00:26:42.888 --> 00:26:45.356
I'm sorry.

00:26:46.652 --> 00:26:49.748
Let's get you guys out of here. Then
we'll take care of those bastards.

00:26:49.783 --> 00:26:51.923
It takes a key, key?

00:26:51.958 --> 00:26:53.268
I don't know.

00:26:53.303 --> 00:26:55.186
All right, I better go find it.

00:26:55.221 --> 00:26:56.858
Hey.

00:26:57.236 --> 00:26:59.159
Be careful.

00:26:59.395 --> 00:27:01.368
Yeah.

00:28:12.981 --> 00:28:14.988
Well, I'll say it again.

00:28:15.024 --> 00:28:17.623
Demons I get.

00:28:17.791 --> 00:28:20.217
People are crazy.

00:29:10.242 --> 00:29:11.853
What the...

00:30:48.092 --> 00:30:50.770
It's okay. I'm not gonna hurt you.

00:30:51.104 --> 00:30:52.819
I know.

00:30:53.029 --> 00:30:54.325
Daddy!

00:30:54.451 --> 00:30:55.790
Daddy!

00:30:56.040 --> 00:30:57.588
Daddy!

00:30:58.216 --> 00:31:00.056
Daddy!

00:31:28.550 --> 00:31:31.646
I'm gonna kick your ass first.

00:31:31.980 --> 00:31:33.904
Then yours.

00:31:45.826 --> 00:31:47.624
Come on.

00:31:47.792 --> 00:31:49.179
Let's hunt.

00:31:49.214 --> 00:31:51.180
Yeah, this one's a fighter.

00:31:51.215 --> 00:31:54.191
Sure be fun to hunt.

00:31:54.861 --> 00:31:56.750
Oh, you got to be kidding me.

00:31:56.785 --> 00:31:58.877
This is what this is about? You...

00:31:58.912 --> 00:32:01.721
You yahoos hunt people?

00:32:03.227 --> 00:32:06.699
You ever killed before?

00:32:06.734 --> 00:32:08.707
What?

00:32:10.003 --> 00:32:12.639
Well, it depends on what you mean.

00:32:12.674 --> 00:32:15.992
I've hunted all my life.

00:32:16.027 --> 00:32:19.750
Just like my father, his before him.

00:32:19.785 --> 00:32:21.883
I've hunted deer...

00:32:21.918 --> 00:32:23.688
And bear...

00:32:23.723 --> 00:32:27.781
I even got a coo-Coo once. Oh boy.

00:32:28.199 --> 00:32:31.002
But the best hunt...

00:32:31.037 --> 00:32:33.512
Is human.

00:32:34.683 --> 00:32:37.492
Oh, there's nothing like it.

00:32:37.527 --> 00:32:42.010
Holding their life in your hands.

00:32:42.045 --> 00:32:46.981
Seeing the fear in their
eyes just before they go dark.

00:32:47.016 --> 00:32:50.913
Makes you feel powerful alive.

00:32:51.149 --> 00:32:53.875
You're a sick puppy.

00:32:54.544 --> 00:32:56.726
We give them a weapon.

00:32:56.761 --> 00:32:59.647
Give him a fighting chance.

00:32:59.882 --> 00:33:02.197
It's kind of like...

00:33:02.232 --> 00:33:05.250
Our tradition passed down

00:33:05.285 --> 00:33:10.521
Father to son, cost
only one or two a year.

00:33:10.556 --> 00:33:15.617
Never enough to bring the lot
down we've never been that sloppy.

00:33:15.652 --> 00:33:18.169
Yeah, well. Don't save yourself short.

00:33:18.204 --> 00:33:20.888
You're plenty of sloppy.

00:33:22.226 --> 00:33:26.201
So what? You're with that pretty cop?

00:33:31.513 --> 00:33:34.525
Are you a cop?

00:33:36.156 --> 00:33:38.714
If I tell you...

00:33:38.749 --> 00:33:42.639
You promise not to make
me into an ash tray?

00:33:46.914 --> 00:33:50.511
Only reason I don't let my
boys take you right here now

00:33:50.546 --> 00:33:54.032
Is that there's
something I need to know.

00:33:54.067 --> 00:33:56.861
Yeah, how about it's not
nice to marry your sister.

00:33:57.734 --> 00:34:03.437
Tell me, any of the cops
go come looking for you?

00:34:03.472 --> 00:34:04.782
Oh, eat me.

00:34:04.817 --> 00:34:08.122
No, no, no. Wait. You actually might.

00:34:10.632 --> 00:34:13.524
You think this is funny?

00:34:13.559 --> 00:34:17.492
You've brought this down on my family.

00:34:19.240 --> 00:34:21.213
All right?

00:34:21.248 --> 00:34:24.280
You want to play games?

00:34:24.316 --> 00:34:27.313
We'll play some games.

00:34:29.614 --> 00:34:34.341
Looks like we're gonna have a
hunt tonight after all, boys.

00:34:34.376 --> 00:34:37.436
And you get to pick the animal.

00:34:37.471 --> 00:34:39.817
The boy or the cop.

00:34:39.852 --> 00:34:42.162
Okay, wait, wait.

00:34:42.748 --> 00:34:45.635
Look, nobody's coming for
me. All right? It's just us.

00:34:45.670 --> 00:34:48.897
You don't choose, I will.

00:34:50.445 --> 00:34:53.875
Oh, you son of a bitch!

00:34:58.560 --> 00:35:01.244
Next time, I'll take an eye.

00:35:01.279 --> 00:35:05.086
All right, all right. The
guy. The guy. Take the guy!

00:35:05.713 --> 00:35:07.477
Lee.

00:35:07.813 --> 00:35:10.280
Go do it.

00:35:10.825 --> 00:35:13.438
Don't let him out though.

00:35:13.473 --> 00:35:16.053
Shoot him in the cage.

00:35:17.182 --> 00:35:19.232
What?

00:35:19.442 --> 00:35:21.223
I thought you said you
were gonna hunt him.

00:35:21.258 --> 00:35:22.493
You're gonna give him a chance!

00:35:22.528 --> 00:35:24.069
Lee!

00:35:24.104 --> 00:35:25.967
When you're done with the boy.

00:35:26.002 --> 00:35:28.936
Shoot the bitch too.

00:35:31.279 --> 00:35:36.759
We're cleaning this mess up before
any more cops come running out here.

00:35:45.585 --> 00:35:47.467
What are you doing?

00:35:55.624 --> 00:35:56.795
Hey!

00:35:58.845 --> 00:36:01.313
You hurt my brother,
I'll kill you. I swear.

00:36:01.349 --> 00:36:03.735
I'll kill you all.

00:36:03.771 --> 00:36:06.123
I will kill you all!

00:36:06.800 --> 00:36:08.683
Lee!

00:36:18.889 --> 00:36:20.562
Damn.

00:36:25.792 --> 00:36:27.464
Lee!

00:36:29.640 --> 00:36:32.316
Jack, you come with me.

00:36:32.352 --> 00:36:33.781
Missy.

00:36:33.990 --> 00:36:36.416
You watch him now.

00:36:45.284 --> 00:36:46.498
Lee?

00:36:46.790 --> 00:36:48.547
Where are you?

00:36:52.604 --> 00:36:54.069
Lee?

00:36:56.152 --> 00:36:58.745
Damn it. Jack, hit the lights.

00:37:00.083 --> 00:37:02.509
They must have pulled the fuses.

00:38:34.318 --> 00:38:36.024
You stupid...

00:38:37.028 --> 00:38:38.282
Hey!

00:39:14.339 --> 00:39:16.306
I'll watch this one. You go ahead.

00:39:20.999 --> 00:39:23.592
Go ahead.

00:39:34.092 --> 00:39:36.525
You hurt my family.

00:39:36.560 --> 00:39:39.090
I'm gonna bleed you bitch.

00:39:39.125 --> 00:39:41.622
You killed my brother.

00:39:41.657 --> 00:39:44.005
Your brother?

00:39:45.219 --> 00:39:47.107
Now I see.

00:39:47.143 --> 00:39:49.736
Just tell me why.

00:39:51.252 --> 00:39:54.003
Because it's fun.

00:40:16.933 --> 00:40:17.750
Where's the girl?

00:40:17.785 --> 00:40:19.157
I locked her in the closet.

00:40:19.192 --> 00:40:21.325
What about the dad?

00:40:22.957 --> 00:40:26.596
Shot. Trying to escape.

00:40:37.262 --> 00:40:40.525
I think the car's at the police station.

00:40:40.692 --> 00:40:43.997
Backup units on route to your location.

00:40:46.590 --> 00:40:48.431
So...

00:40:48.766 --> 00:40:52.070
State Police and the FBI are
gonna be here within the hour.

00:40:52.105 --> 00:40:54.998
They're gonna want to talk to you.

00:40:55.500 --> 00:40:59.809
I suggest that you're
both long gone by then.

00:40:59.976 --> 00:41:01.817
Thanks.

00:41:04.033 --> 00:41:05.811
Hey, listen. I don't
mean to press our luck.

00:41:05.846 --> 00:41:07.589
But we're kind of in
the middle of nowhere.

00:41:07.624 --> 00:41:09.973
You think we could catch a ride?

00:41:10.008 --> 00:41:12.274
Start walking.

00:41:13.361 --> 00:41:15.787
Duck if you see a SWAT car.

00:41:15.822 --> 00:41:18.214
Sounds great to me. Thanks.

00:41:18.925 --> 00:41:20.849
Listen...

00:41:22.589 --> 00:41:25.391
I'm sorry about your brother.

00:41:25.851 --> 00:41:27.859
Thank you.

00:41:29.198 --> 00:41:30.753
It was really hard not
knowing what happened to him.

00:41:30.788 --> 00:41:36.309
I thought it would be easier
once I knew the truth. But...

00:41:37.438 --> 00:41:39.864
It isn't really.

00:41:44.717 --> 00:41:47.352
Anyway you should go.

00:42:00.654 --> 00:42:03.164
Don't ever do that again.

00:42:03.199 --> 00:42:04.341
Do what?

00:42:04.376 --> 00:42:06.343
Go missing like that.

00:42:07.765 --> 00:42:10.066
You were worried about me.

00:42:10.819 --> 00:42:14.500
I'm saying, you vanish like that
again I'm not looking for you.

00:42:14.793 --> 00:42:15.816
Sure you will.

00:42:15.851 --> 00:42:16.575
I'm not.

00:42:17.427 --> 00:42:19.693
So you got saddled on by
a 13 year old girl, huh?

00:42:19.728 --> 00:42:20.717
Oh, shut up!

00:42:20.752 --> 00:42:22.695
Just saying getting rusty there, kiddo.

00:42:23.242 --> 00:42:24.915
Shut up!

